    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr. Jai Das, Assistant Director of the Institute for Global Health and Development (IGHD), participated in the inaugural GLIDE Symposium, held in Abu Dhabi just one week ago. This landmark event brought together over 100 participants from more than 30 countries, fostering dynamic discussions on accelerating disease elimination and eradication efforts worldwide.",
